{{JPExclusive}}
'''Catnip Tricky''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Collaboration Event Capsule|Event Cat Capsule]] during the [[JRA Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 10.10 Update|Version 10.10]]. Like [[Cat Giraffe Modoki (Special Cat)|Cat Giraffe Modoki]] and [[Catnip Dragon (Special Cat)|Catnip Dragon]], it is capped at level 1, meaning it can only be upgraded using +levels.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 627
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Catnip Tricky
|name2 = Tenma Catnip Tricky
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Tenma Catnip Tricky''' at level 1+9.

==Strategy/Usage==
With its terrible everything besides DPS even at level 1+30, just about any decent [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attacker]] with the same or lower cost can replace it, from [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Bird Cat]] to [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]].

{{Job|Classification = Combo Slave & Melee}}

